Design a Vole machine (Brookshear machine) simulator in an object-oriented way.
Include: Machine, CPU, ALU, Registers (16 x 8-bit), Memory (256 cells),
Instruction decoding (opcodes 1-C), and a Screen/Output.
Storing to address 00 writes the value to the screen.

The design must be able to run these two programs:

Program 1 (sum 1+2+3+4+5, result 0F):
2001 2102 2203 2304 2405 5501 5552 5553 5554 3500 C000

Program 2 (6 x 3 using addition, result 12):
2006 5100 5210 3200 C000

Produce a PlantUML class diagram with attributes, methods,
visibility, and relationships (association, composition, etc.).
Return only valid PlantUML code.